"<h1>Window-specific Settings</h1> Here you can customize window settings "
"specifically only for some windows. "
"<p>Please note that this configuration will not take effect if you do not "
"use KWin as your window manager. If you do use a different window manager, "
"please refer to its documentation for how to customize window behavior."
